NAME
  vtkSHYXSnappyHexMesh
DESCRIPTION
  "Hex-dominant volume mesh from a PartitionedDataSetCollection (or PolyData) using snappyHexMesh; output is vtkOpenFOAMReader MultiBlockDataSet."
GROUPS
  Vascular
DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
  VTK::FiltersCore
  VTK::FiltersGeometry
PRIVATE_DEPENDS
  VTK::IOGeometry
